        ->  Table Scan on vector_scalar_query.items  𝄀
              Filter Cond: (ref.id = 'b')  𝄀
  ->  Project  𝄀
        ->  Sort  𝄀
              Sort Key: #[0,1] INTERNAL  𝄀
              Limit: 2  𝄀
              ->  Join  𝄀
                    Join Type: INNER  𝄀
                    Join Cond: (items.id = #[1,1])  𝄀
                    Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
                    ->  Table Scan on vector_scalar_query.items  𝄀
                          Runtime Filter Probe: items.id  𝄀
                    ->  CROSS APPLY  𝄀
                          ->  Scalar Vector Source  𝄀
                          ->  Vector Index Scan on ix [l2_distance]  𝄀
                                Vector Index: ix, Metric: l2_distance, Candidate Limit: 2, NProbe: 5  𝄀
  ->  Project  𝄀
        ->  Sort  𝄀
              Sort Key: l2_distance(items.v, #[0,2]) INTERNAL  𝄀
              Limit: 2  𝄀
              ->  Join  𝄀
                    Join Type: SINGLE  𝄀
                    ->  Table Scan on vector_scalar_query.items  𝄀
                    ->  Scalar Vector Source
explain select id from items order by l2_distance(v, (select v from items ref where ref.id='b')) limit 2;
