➤ AP QUERY PLAN ON ONE CN(10 core)[12,-1,0]  𝄀
Scalar Vector Query  𝄀
  Limit: 2  𝄀
  ->  Project  𝄀
        ->  Table Scan on vector_scalar_query.items  𝄀
              Filter Cond: (ref.id = 'absent')  𝄀
